  "serviceTermsContent": "Welcome to the Blipin Merchant App (the App or the Service).\nTo help you use all features and information safely, these terms explain the privacy and service rules that apply to the App and protect your rights. Please read the following carefully.\n\n1. Scope\nThis policy explains how Blipin collects, processes, and uses personal data when you use the merchant App. It applies to the Blipin mobile application and its administration system, but not to third-party applications, websites, or services outside Blipin.\n\n2. Collection and use of data\nWhen you register as a merchant and use the App, we may collect necessary merchant or personal data, including merchant name, contact name, email, phone number, business address, menu and stall information, photos, device information, IP address, and login time. We use this data to verify merchant identity, manage accounts, process notifications, locations, and orders, improve service quality, and perform internal analysis. We will not use your data for unrelated purposes without written consent.\n\n3. Data protection\nOur systems use firewalls, antivirus software, access controls, and other security measures to protect merchant and personal data. Only authorized personnel may access it and all relevant staff are bound by confidentiality agreements.\n\n4. App permissions\nThe App may request location, camera, photo library, and notification permissions only when necessary. You may change these permissions in your device settings, but some features may not work correctly.\n\n5. Sharing with third parties\nWe will not provide, exchange, rent, or sell your data to third parties except with your written consent, when required by law, to prevent danger to life or property, for an investigation, or for anonymized statistical and public-interest purposes.\n\n6. Related technology\nThe App or its backend may record login status, preferences, and usage history to improve your experience. You may disable these records in your device settings, but some features may be affected.\n\n7. Retention and deletion\nData is retained while your account is active to operate the service. When you delete your account or stop using the service, we will delete data within 30 days or retain required records as required by law.\n\n8. Changes\nWe may update these terms for legal, business, or technical changes. Updates will be announced in the App or on the official website.\n\n9. Contact\nFor questions or requests to access, correct, or delete personal data, contact us at support@blipin.com. Blipin Customer Support Center",
  "@serviceTermsContent": {
    "description": "Service terms content"
  }
